  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">PIMS 9651 ARG/D24/G65 - Recovering the Sustainability of Affected Ecosystems by Drought In Northeastern Argentina</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">The objective of the GEF PPG is to develop the project concept into a full project: Recovering the sustainability of affected ecosystems by drought in the in northeastern of Argentina. As described in the project concept (PIF), this project aims to strengthen sustainable land management (SLM) of degraded ecosystems in accordance with land degradation neutrality (LDN) in drought-affected areas in northeastern Argentina.</narrative>
  </description>
